			                'PEAKING_PLANTS_PROFILES'[FiscalCycleStart] = SELECTEDVALUE('PEAKING_PLANTS_PROFILES'[FiscalCycleStart])
			            )
			        ),
			        "YYYYMMDD"
			    )
			)
			
			```
